<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">A PHOTO, A LITTLE MEMORY</view><view class="heading">拍下这一餐，<view>把日子认真记好。</view></view><view class="subtitle">好好吃饭，就是今天最温柔的小事。</view><view class="notice warn section"><text class="mock-tag">模拟识餐</text><view class="mt-sm">当前不分析照片内容，会生成固定的「鸡肉蔬菜饭」样例。样例数据会写入当天日记，并消耗一次模拟额度。</view></view><view class="quota-bar mt"><view class="row"><view><text class="label">今日模拟识餐额度</text><view class="quota-number">{{access.remaining}}<text class="unit">/ {{membership.dailyLimit + access.freeCredits + access.adCredits}} 次剩余</text></view></view><button class="link" data-url="{{signedIn ? '/pages/membership/index' : '/pages/account/index'}}" bindtap="go">{{signedIn ? '查看权益 ›' : '先登录 ›'}}</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{adPlacement.enabled}}" class="notice section">本地模拟广告占位 · 识餐Banner · {{adPlacement.unitId}}（未请求真实广告）</view><view class="card section"><view class="title">共享次数</view><view class="caption mt">会员剩余{{access.membershipRemaining}}次 · 免费{{access.freeCredits}}次 · 广告奖励{{access.adCredits}}次</view><view class="caption mt">{{access.requiresCredit ? "本会员含广告：使用会员日额度时还需消耗1次免费或广告永久额度。" : access.membershipRemaining ? "免广告会员每日额度可直接使用。" : "当前使用免费或广告永久次数。"}} 全局今日剩余{{access.globalRemaining}}次 · {{access.photoEnabled ? '模拟识餐已启用' : '管理员已暂停模拟识餐'}}</view><button class="btn white mt" data-url="/pages/ai-plan/index" bindtap="go">用同一份次数，制定AI日常计划</button><button class="btn white mt" bindtap="beginVideo" disabled="{{busy || !access.adsAvailable || video}}">模拟观看激励视频，领取识餐次数</button><view wx:if="{{video}}" class="notice warn mt"><view>本地视频流程模拟，未加载真实广告。只有完整观看完成才赠送次数。</view><button class="btn mt" data-complete="yes" bindtap="endVideo">模拟完整观看结束</button><button class="btn white mt" data-complete="no" bindtap="endVideo">模拟中途关闭（不赠送）</button></view></view><view class="card section photo-card"><image wx:if="{{preview}}" class="food-preview" src="{{preview}}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="previewPhoto"/><view wx:else class="camera-zone"><view class="camera-circle"><image src="/images/ui/camera.svg"/></view><view class="title mt">每一餐，都值得被好好记录</view><text class="small-text mt-sm">拍照或从相册选择 · 图片不超过 8 MB</text></view><view wx:if="{{photoError}}" class="error-inline">{{photoError}}</view><button class="btn mt" disabled="{{busy || (signedIn && (!access.remaining || !access.photoEnabled || !access.globalRemaining))}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="choose">{{busy ? '正在保存模拟记录…' : preview ? '换一张照片，生成新记录' : '选择照片，开始模拟体验 ↗'}}</button><button wx:if="{{photoError && preview}}" class="btn white mt" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="retryRecognition">重试保存这张照片</button><view wx:if="{{signedIn && !access.remaining}}" class="form-hint mt">今日额度已用完或暂无有效权益，可查看会员权益或参与挑战。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card section result-card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">这一餐，已经记好</text><text class="pill">模拟结果</text></view><view class="title mt">{{result.name}}</view><view class="result-energy"><text>{{result.kcal}}</text><text class="unit">kcal · 估算热量</text></view><view class="grid3 nutrition"><view><text class="number">{{result.protein}}<text class="unit">g</text></text><text class="caption">蛋白质</text></view><view><text class="number">{{result.carbohydrate}}<text class="unit">g</text></text><text class="caption">碳水化合物</text></view><view><text class="number">{{result.fat}}<text class="unit">g</text></text><text class="caption">脂肪</text></view></view><view class="notice mt">已归入 {{result.date}} · {{slotLabel}}。以上营养为固定模拟值，不代表照片中的真实营养。{{result.corrected ? "名称与热量已手动调整，宏量营养仍为演示值。" : ""}}</view><view class="card mt"><view class="title">核对并手动调整（不重复扣次）</view><input value="{{editName}}" data-key="editName" bindinput="editInput" placeholder="餐食名称"/><input type="digit" value="{{editKcal}}" data-key="editKcal" bindinput="editInput" placeholder="热量kcal"/><button class="btn white mt" bindtap="correctMeal">保存调整</button><button class="btn white mt" bindtap="deleteMeal">删除本次餐食记录（不返额度）</button></view><button class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/health/index?date={{result.date}}" bindtap="go">去日记看看这一餐 ↗</button></view><view class="section photo-flow"><view><text class="flow-no">01</text><text>选择照片</text></view><text>→</text><view><text class="flow-no">02</text><text>生成模拟样例</text></view><text>→</text><view><text class="flow-no">03</text><text>记入当天日记</text></view></view><view class="notice section"><view class="row start"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/shield.svg"/><text>照片只保存在本机，不上传后台，不展示在公开榜。</text></view></view>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
